  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>At 7th level, when you or a creature within <strong>30 feet</strong> of you fails a saving throw against an effect that applies the <strong>Charmed</strong> or <strong>Frightened</strong> condition, you can use your <strong>Reaction</strong> to force that creature to reroll the saving throw with <strong>Advantage</strong>.</p><p>The creature must use the new roll.</p>"
    },
